NAME
    callers - find static call/jump references to an address

SYNOPSIS
    callers <addr> [<scanstart> <scanlen>]

DESCRIPTION
    Scans CpuBus (default: <addr>'s own bank, $8000-$FFFF) for instructions
    statically calling/jumping to <addr> - a static-analysis alternative to
    setting a breakpoint and waiting for it to hit: finds every place that
    COULD jump there, whether or not it was ever actually reached during a
    given play session. See 'writers'/'readers' for the memory-access
    equivalents.

EXAMPLES
    callers 8000
